# Fast gate before each commit (~15 s, decision 0008). The full suite runs in pre-push.
# First the test guard (staged changes need a test, decision 0007), so a missing test fails in a second.
# Then fix and lint the staged files, then typecheck and run every unit and script test.
# Skip once with: git commit --no-verify
node scripts/testGuard.mjs
pnpm exec lint-staged
node scripts/checks.mjs commit
